  "goodToKnow": "Untertauchen means to dive under water, and figuratively to go into hiding or disappear: Der Täter ist untergetaucht. During the Nazi era, thousands of Jews survived by untertauchen in Berlin, called U-Boote. Transitively with haben, jemanden untertauchen means to dunk someone. Tauchen means to dive. Separable: tauchte unter, ist untergetaucht."
